      "name": "Orgs Stats - Devices",
      "description": {
        "content": "API Calls to retrieve statistics about the Mist Managed and Monitored Devices at the Org level\n\n\nBy default, the API call only returns a subset of the available fields. Additional fields can be requested by adding the query parameter `fields=` and the list of fields, or `fields=*` to retrieve all the available fields.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
